requirements extension_fees v1
description "Where the tables of the rule extension_fees.rule come from: two sections of 37 CFR part 1, copied here and pinned (the copies have the bytes of the rule's own), and the rule's tables named one by one. A test material; the rule is a sketch and does not say how any regulation is read"

role legal "Decides how the words of a regulation are read"
role development "Writes and fixes the rule"

source cfr = law ecfr "37 CFR 1" asof 2026-01-01
  "§1.17" sha256:9b48f2c46284140a
  "§1.27" sha256:fea1289ebe564f77

scope rulec "rules/extension_fees.rule" table

requirement standard_fee
  text "The fee for an extension of time to reply is set by the month of the reply, from the first to the fifth, and no fee is charged when no extension is taken"
  in force 2026-01-01..
  owner legal
  from @cfr "§1.17"
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by legal sha256:9b48f2c46284140a -> sha256:717b0eb89e528849
  satisfied by rulec "rules/extension_fees.rule" table standard_fee
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by development sha256:717b0eb89e528849 -> sha256:9c75e7072bde2938
  satisfied by rulec "rules/extension_fees.rule" clause no_extension
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by development sha256:717b0eb89e528849 -> sha256:2391acd18f47abcb
  not verified "That the table covers every month and that its rows do not overlap is checked by rulec. This material has no claim that names it"
    approved 2026-10-04 by legal sha256:717b0eb89e528849

requirement small_entity_fee
  text "A small entity pays the lower fee of its own table for a reply made by the date the table holds to"
  in force 2026-01-01..
  owner legal
  from @cfr "§1.27"
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by legal sha256:fea1289ebe564f77 -> sha256:a1a6e62ebeedb230
  satisfied by rulec "rules/extension_fees.rule" table small_entity_fee
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by development sha256:a1a6e62ebeedb230 -> sha256:5fd98a7705c641eb
  satisfied by rulec "rules/extension_fees.rule" define reduced_period
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by development sha256:a1a6e62ebeedb230 -> sha256:611179d6b0c376c4
  not verified "That the small entity's table is read before the standard table is checked by rulec. This material has no claim that names it"
    approved 2026-10-04 by legal sha256:a1a6e62ebeedb230
